{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/be79343ee1ba7ef938389615ea817acc.avif?t=1771473683\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Grow. Sell. Expand. Protect your home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Hawkers</strong> blends the best of a Farming Sim with the thrill of a shop tycoon. Beyond harvesting\u2026 you <strong>build a life</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Plant crops, raise animals, craft goods, and design your own business to become the economic heart of the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But the more your success grows, the clearer something unsettling becomes:<br><strong>someone is buying everything in silence\u2026</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \ud83c\udf31 <strong>From the soil to the shelf</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water, and harvest crops through a day-by-day growth cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise animals and manage resources to improve your production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and prepare goods to sell at the best price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills and unlock new farming possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/b6fd7b73b5bb841c8ccff5a3249d849f.poster.avif?t=1771473683\" width=600 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/b6fd7b73b5bb841c8ccff5a3249d849f.webm?t=1771473683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfea <strong>Your store, your rules</strong><br>Build your shop from scratch and turn it into something truly yours.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the layout: shelves, d\u00e9cor, and store organization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what products to sell and how to display them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage profits, reinvest, and expand step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy peaceful days\u2026 and also busy rush moments with unpredictable customers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/343a88b3bc318ab0c441de464d3520d2.poster.avif?t=1771473683\" width=416 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/343a88b3bc318ab0c441de464d3520d2.webm?t=1771473683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/6cd08c599f0c3c048de7c5c9fb6b128c.avif?t=1771473683\" width=1155 height=978 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Tycoon strategy without losing the cozy vibe</strong><br>Your decisions matter:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance time, money, and production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan upgrades: farm, store, tools, and home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your growth and build a sustainable empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 <strong>Town, characters, and relationships</strong><br>Meet the locals, build relationships, and earn your place in the community.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with personality, routines, and small stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Events and special moments that make the town feel alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress isn\u2019t measured only in money \u2014 but also in connections. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/329de5b93ea7eae9e798f5c5eeeb3126.poster.avif?t=1771473683\" width=630 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/329de5b93ea7eae9e798f5c5eeeb3126.webm?t=1771473683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/f1d8ab74474305ca29235bb0b57083a5.poster.avif?t=1771473683\" width=126 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105060/extras/f1d8ab74474305ca29235bb0b57083a5.webm?t=1771473683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>A hidden mystery beneath the calm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your story begins with childhood memories alongside your grandfather\u2026 and a return to town years later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A powerful businessman (Mr. Bunny) is quietly buying everything around y